h.\n\nThe flooring combines light stone tiles near the table with warm wooden decking, creating a seamless and earthy transition. The perimeter of the space is lined with lush green plants, ensuring privacy and adding freshness to the environment. To the right is a sleek outdoor kitchen featuring black cabinetry, a stainless steel grill, and a countertop with wine bottles and glassware.\n\nPlayful orange exercise balls rest on the floor near the seating area, subtly suggesting a multipurpose space for relaxation and activity. The combination of greenery, modern furnishings, and functional design creates an inviting and stylish ambiance ideal for entertaining or unwinding."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 225, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [639.2947998046875, 159.72271728515625], "pos": [1113.81201171875, 927.3134765625], "id": 144, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 31}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "describe", "slot_index": 0, "links": [225], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Please provide a detailed description of this image. If any characters in the image are familiar to you, such as celebrities, movie characters, or animated figures, please directly use their names. The description should be as detailed as possible, but should not exceed 300 words."], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 213, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "RH_Captioner", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [636.5349731445312, 89.88819885253906], "pos": [1112.2003173828125, 803.3284912109375], "id": 61, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 29}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [211, 230], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name":